: 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le16ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le16ob08re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn5le16ob08re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn5le16ob08re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thank you for seeing me.  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charles</span>: No problem, Sally. I heard you are quite ambitious. What would you like to talk about?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I am used to blogging. Could you give me some advice on how to write magazine articles?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charles</span>: Writing an article takes time, research and planning.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I see. How do I start? What steps should I take?", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn5le16ob08re2img03.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Charles</span>: First, choose a topic that interests you. Then, do your research. If you don't do your research,  your information will not be accurate.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: OK, I need to become a more organized person.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charles</span>: Then, it is essential that you know who you are writing for.  If you don't think about your audience you won't engage them.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I see.  I need to think about my readers \u2026 their wants, needs, and interests.", "time": "23000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn5le16ob08re2img03.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Charles</span>: Remember, never hand in a rough draft. If you don't proofread your work, you will not be taken seriously as a writer.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thank you for being so helpful!", "time": "52200", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "text", "id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": "engenn5le16ob08re6aud02"}], "_data": []}, {"templ